# .voice-cache is COMMITTED. It is 6.9MB of pre-rendered Polly speech, and
# the deployed host cannot render its own: iam:CreateInstanceProfile is
# denied on this account, so the instance cannot be given a role that calls
# Polly. Shipping the clips needs no AWS permissions at all.
# .voice-cache/
*.wav
